{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":1,"timestamp":"2026-07-22T15:42:58.375831Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"ee3065c4-b7dd-4371-b44d-b7dd7ad6bae5","comment_uuid":"21f97c54-1ca9-4dd9-bfef-7d2f01536a90","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"VSDD-CLI CUTOVER COMPLETE: migrate (genesis from fresh 08:18:45 tip) + immediate finalize at 15:37:52Z. Pre-cutover discovery: the real db had ALREADY self-healed its 11858 duplicate comments via post-swap 0.9 read-traffic hydration (12810->964 before migration). Post: 741 issues == reduced state after purging the same 17 shadows the rehearsal predicted; 964 comments; 8 stale locks surfaced by v3 event accounting and released; integrity all-PASS. v2 deleted; backups retained (branch + sqlite .backup).","created_at":"2026-07-22T15:42:58.375811Z","kind":"result"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-07-22T15:43:52.792677Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"89b50e39-951f-4a33-ba60-26460565c4fd","comment_uuid":"9e5b754e-a96e-4524-b652-a17dfd54afcd","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"MDATRON CUTOVER COMPLETE (after recovery): initial migrate at 08:32 used a stale genesis (missed 79Ig's 08:18-08:20 #76 work - pre-flight fetch was 08:07 and migrate does not re-fetch v2 before cutting the genesis; AC-6 finalize guard correctly refused and prevented data loss). Recovery per forecast-bio#653 remedy: --remigrate-from-v2 regenerated genesis from true tip (76 issues, 204 comments incl. #76 work), immediate finalize at 15:40:25Z, 3 stale locks re-released, integrity all-PASS. v2 deleted; backups retained. Hooks refreshed to 0.9-era. UPSTREAM CANDIDATE: migrate hub-v3 should fetch the v2 hub immediately before building the genesis.","created_at":"2026-07-22T15:43:52.792659Z","kind":"result"}}
